                  <span>
                    Participants aged 16 or 17 must be accompanied by a parent
                    or guardian.
                  </span>
                </dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
            <p>
              Whether you’re a student, an international resident or an
              experienced developer, bring your curiosity. Check the event
              listing for team formation, overnight access rules and language
              support.
            </p>
            <p>
              The venue is planned to stay open for 48 hours, but you don’t need
              to keep working without a break. Make time to rest, too.
            </p>
